 --> 00:33:35.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这是我听过的最了不起的回答\n\nA487\n00:33:35.410 --> 00:33:38.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你他妈的智商一定有<i>160</i>\n\nA488\n00:33:38.080 --> 00:33:40.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你他妈的真有天赋 列兵阿甘\n\nA489\n00:33:41.920 --> 00:33:44.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n大家都听着\n\nA490\n00:33:44.250 --> 00:33:47.990 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不知为什么 我很适应军队\n就像圆榫头找对了孔\n\nA491\n00:33:48.060 --> 00:33:49.520 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n其实并不难\n\nA492\n00:33:49.590 --> 00:33:52.930 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你只需把你的床铺好 记着要站得笔直\n\nA493\n00:33:53.100 --> 00:33:57.500 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不管回答什么问题 都说 是 教官\n\nA494\n00:33:57.770 --> 00:33:59.200 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n听明白没有？\n\nA495\n00:33:59.270 --> 00:34:01.540 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n是 教官\n\nA496\n00:34:01.610 --> 00:34:05.040 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你只需要沿着海底拖你的网\n\nA497\n00:34:05.110 --> 00:34:08.140 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n收成好时能捕到<i>100</i>多磅虾\n\nA498\n00:34:08.450 --> 00:34:10.210 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n如果一切顺利\n\nA499\n00:34:10.380 --> 00:34:12.550 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n<i>2</i>个人捕<i>10</i>个小时\n\nA500\n00:34:12.620 --> 00:34:14.710 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n减去你用掉的油费\n\nA501\n00:34:14.790 --> 00:34:16.880 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n完成了 教官\n\nA502\n00:34:16.960 --> 00:34:18.390 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n阿甘\n\nA503\n00:34:19.960 --> 00:34:22.900 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你怎么这么快就把枪装好了？\n\nA504\n00:34:22.970 --> 00:34:24.900 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你叫我这么做的 教官\n\nA505\n00:34:24.970 --> 00:34:26.560 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n耶稣基督啊\n\nA506\n00:34:26.640 --> 00:34:28.270 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这是新的连队纪录\n\nA507\n00:34:28.440 --> 00:34:31.040 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n要不是舍不得你这个好兵\n\nA508\n00:34:31.140 --> 00:34:33.280 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我就推荐你去军官学校 阿甘列兵\n\nA509\n00:34:33.300 --> 00:34:35.410 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n有朝一日你会当上将军\n\nA510\n00:34:35.480 --> 00:34:38.420 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n现在拆开枪 继续练习\n\nA511\n00:34:40.090 --> 00:34:42.020 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n总之 就像我说过的\n\nA512\n00:34:42.090 --> 00:34:44.360 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾就是大海的果实\n\nA513\n00:34:44.430 --> 00:34:47.690 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你可以烧它 煮它 烤它\n\nA514\n00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:49.200 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n烘它 炒它\n\nA515\n00:34:49.270 --> 00:34:52.360 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n有虾串、克里奥尔虾\n\nA516\n00:34:52.440 --> 00:34:56.370 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾仁浓汤、香煎虾、炸虾\n\nA517\n00:34:56.440 --> 00:34:57.700 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n炒虾\n\nA518\n00:34:57.780 --> 00:34:59.540 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有菠萝虾\n\nA519\n00:34:59.610 --> 00:35:02.480 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n柠檬虾 椰子虾\n\nA520\n00:35:02.550 --> 00:35:03.680 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n胡椒虾\n\nA521\n00:35:03.750 --> 00:35:06.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾汤、炖虾\n\nA522\n00:35:06.250 --> 00:35:07.850 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾仁沙拉\n\nA523\n00:35:07.920 --> 00:35:09.690 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n土豆虾\n\nA524\n00:35:09.760 --> 00:35:11.190 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾肉汉堡包\n\nA525\n00:35:11.260 --> 00:35:13.020 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n虾肉三明治\n\nA526\n00:35:15.270 --> 00:35:17.360 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n大概就这些了\n\nA527\n00:35:21.610 --> 00:35:24.770 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n军队里晚上有点寂寞\n\nA528\n00:35:25.560 --> 00:35:27.280 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们躺在床铺上\n\nA529\n00:35:27.760 --> 00:35:29.780 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我会想念我的妈妈\n\nA530\n00:35:29.850 --> 00:35:32.440 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我也会想念珍妮\n\nA531\n00:35:35.860 --> 00:35:37.790 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 阿甘\n\nA532\n00:35:38.170 --> 00:35:40.450 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n瞧她那对奶子\n\nN387\n00:35:49.066 --> 00:35:50.859 align:middle line:10%,start position:50%,middle\n南方佳丽\n\nA533\n00:35:53.470 --> 00:35:54.650 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n原来\n\nA534\n00:35:54.710 --> 00:35:56.810 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n珍妮惹上麻烦了\n\nA535\n00:35:56.880 --> 00:36:00.150 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n因为几张她穿学校毛衣的照片\n\nA536\n00:36:00.220 --> 00:36:02.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n她被开除学籍\n\nA537\n00:36:06.220 --> 00:36:08.160 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n但那也不算坏事\n\nA538\n00:36:08.520 --> 00:36:10.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n因为有一位剧院老板\n\nA539\n00:36:10.730 --> 00:36:12.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他在田纳西州孟斐斯有家剧院\n\nA540\n00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:13.830 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n看了那些照片\n\nA541\n00:36:13.900 --> 00:36:17.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就给珍妮一个唱歌的工作\n\nA542\n00:36:17.740 --> 00:36:19.840 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我一找到机会\n\nA543\n00:36:19.910 --> 00:36:22.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我就乘车去孟斐斯\n\nA544\n00:36:22.250 --> 00:36:24.510 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n去看她表演节目\n\nA545\n00:36:24.580 --> 00:36:26.020 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n刚才是安珀 安珀·弗莱姆\n\nA546\n00:36:26.090 --> 00:36:27.520 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n请再为她鼓一回掌\n\nA547\n00:36:27.590 --> 00:36:30.520 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n接下来的节目你们一定会喜欢\n\nA548\n00:36:30.590 --> 00:36:32.360 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n来自加州好莱坞\n\nA549\n00:36:32.430 --> 00:36:34.190 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们的叛逆美女\n\nA550\n00:36:34.260 --> 00:36:36.530 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n让我们用最热烈的掌声\n\nA551\n00:36:36.600 --> 00:36:38.360 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n欢迎性感的鲍比·迪伦\n\nN398\n00:36:40.617 --> 00:36:42.953 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 好！\n- 鲍比！\n\nA552\n00:37:05.170 --> 00:37:07.100 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n她的梦想真的实现了\n\nA553\n00:37:09.170 --> 00:37:11.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n她成了一位民谣歌手\n\nA554\n00:37:22.060 --> 00:37:23.390 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n扭起来！\n\nA555\n00:37:23.460 --> 00:37:24.890 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还是给她一把口琴吧\n\nA556\n00:37:28.600 --> 00:37:30.030 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这儿不是《袋鼠船长》！\n\nA557\n00:37:30.100 --> 00:37:32.860 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 甜心 我这里有东西要给你\n\nA558\n00:37:32.940 --> 00:37:34.990 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 去你的\n\nA559\n00:37:35.070 --> 00:37:37.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 你这傻瓜蛋\n\nA560\n00:37:37.410 --> 00:37:39.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我在唱歌\n\nA561\n00:37:42.250 --> 00:37:43.680 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n波莉 出来！\n\nA562\n00:37:43.750 --> 00:37:46.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你闭嘴\n\nA563\n00:37:46.250 --> 00:37:47.720 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n闭嘴\n\nA564\n00:37:50.290 --> 00:37:53.230 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n福雷斯 你怎么在这儿？\n\nA565\n00:37:53.290 --> 00:37:54.630 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你干什么？\n\nA566\n00:37:55.700 --> 00:37:57.460 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你干什么 福雷斯？\n\nA567\n00:37:57.530 --> 00:37:59.560 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n放下我\n\nA568\n00:38:03.730 --> 00:38:06.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你不能老是这样做 福雷斯\n\nA569\n00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:08.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你别老是想着要救我\n\nA570\n00:38:08.740 --> 00:38:10.540 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们刚才想抓你\n\nA571\n00:38:10.610 --> 00:38:12.940 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n很多人都想抓我\n\nA572\n00:38:13.010 --> 00:38:17.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n可是你不能老是这样做\n\nA573\n00:38:18.040 --> 00:38:20.890 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我忍不住 我爱你\n\nA574\n00:38:21.760 --> 00:38:22.680 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n福雷斯\n\nA575\n00:38:23.020 --> 00:38:24.990 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你不知道什么是爱\n\nA576\n00:38:31.730 --> 00:38:34.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你还记得那回祈祷吗 福雷斯？\n\nA577\n00:38:36.070 --> 00:38:40.900 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们求上帝把我变成鸟\n好让我远远地飞走\n\nA578\n00:38:42.750 --> 00:38:44.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n是的 我记得\n\nA579\n00:38:47.320 --> 00:38:50.150 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你觉得我能从桥上飞下去吗？\n\nA580\n00:38:57.000 --> 00:39:00.020 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你什么意思 珍妮？\n\nA581\n00:39:03.210 --> 00:39:04.470 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n没什么\n\nA582\n00:39:07.540 --> 00:39:09.810 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我要离开这里了\n\nA583\n00:39:12.050 --> 00:39:13.140 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n等等 珍妮\n\nA584\n00:39:13.220 --> 00:39:15.650 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n福雷斯 离我远点 好吗？\n\nA585\n00:39:15.720 --> 00:39:17.660 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n请你离我远点\n\nA586\n00:39:17.720 --> 00:39:19.160 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我能搭车吗？\n\nA587\n00:39:19.230 --> 00:39:20.490 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你去哪儿？\n\nA588\n00:39:20.560 --> 00:39:21.650 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我无所谓\n\nA589\n00:39:21.730 --> 00:39:22.960 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n上车吧\n\nA590\n00:39:23.030 --> 00:39:25.230 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那么再见 珍妮\n\nA591\n00:39:26.640 --> 00:39:29.500 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们要送我去越南\n\nA592\n00:39:31.210 --> 00:39:34.040 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那是另外一个国家\n\nA593\n00:39:36.610 --> 00:39:38.380 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n请再等一会儿\n\nA594\n00:39:39.950 --> 00:39:42.890 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n听着 答应我一件事 好吗？\n\nA595\n00:39:42.960 --> 00:39:45.740 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n如果你遇到了麻烦 不要逞能\n\nA596\n00:39:45.990 --> 00:39:49.230 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n只管跑 行吗？跑得远远的\n\nA597\n00:39:49.300 --> 00:39:50.660 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好吧\n\nA598\n00:39:55.400 --> 00:39:57.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n珍妮\n\nA599\n00:39:58.740 --> 00:40:01.840 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我会经常写信给你\n\nA600\n00:40:10.420 --> 00:40:13.990 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就是这样 她走了\n\nA602\n00:40:29.840 --> 00:40:31.680 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你要平平安安地回来\n\nA603\n00:40:31.750 --> 00:40:33.190 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n听见没有？\n\nA604\n00:41:16.230 --> 00:41:17.660 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们告诉我们\n\nA605\n00:41:17.730 --> 00:41:20.670 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n越南完全不一样\n\nA606\n00:41:20.740 --> 00:41:22.760 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n和美利坚合众国相比\n\nA607\n00:41:22.840 --> 00:41:26.930 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n除了啤酒罐和烧烤以外\n\nA608\n00:41:27.010 --> 00:41:28.770 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n的确如此\n\nA609\n00:41:38.520 --> 00:41:41.610 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 我敢打赌这水里全都是虾\n\nA610\n00:41:41.690 --> 00:41:44.630 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n听说这儿的虾很不错\n\nA611\n00:41:44.690 --> 00:41:46.630 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n等我们赢了这场战争\n\nA612\n00:41:46.700 --> 00:41:48.320 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们就接管所有东西\n\nA613\n00:41:48.400 --> 00:41:50.660 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们可以把美国捕虾船开过来\n\nA614\n00:41:50.730 --> 00:41:51.990 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n在这水里捕虾\n\nA615\n00:41:52.070 --> 00:41:54.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n一天到晚捕虾 兄弟\n\nA616\n00:41:56.740 --> 00:41:59.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你们就是新来的菜鸟吧\n\nA617\n00:41:59.070 --> 00:42:00.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n早上好 长官\n\nA618\n00:42:00.240 --> 00:42:01.770 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n啊 把你们的手放下\n\nA619\n00:42:02.160 --> 00:42:03.550 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不要向我敬礼\n\nA620\n00:42:03.610 --> 00:42:05.780 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这一带有他妈的很多狙击手\n\nA621\n00:42:05.850 --> 00:42:07.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n最想干掉军官\n\nA622\n00:42:08.410 --> 00:42:11.280 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我是丹·泰勒中尉 欢迎来到第<i>4</i>排\n\nA623\n00:42:12.840 --> 00:42:14.110 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你的嘴唇怎么了？\n\nA624\n00:42:15.500 --> 00:42:17.720 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我天生牙龈就大 长官\n\nA625\n00:42:17.820 --> 00:42:19.620 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嗯 你最好把它吸进去点\n\nA626\n00:42:19.870 --> 00:42:22.130 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不然会碰到地雷线\n\nA627\n00:42:23.760 --> 00:42:25.210 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你们都从哪儿来的？\n\nA628\n00:42:25.260 --> 00:42:26.960 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 阿拉巴马 长官\n- 阿拉巴马 长官\n\nA629\n00:42:28.380 --> 00:42:29.390 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你俩是双胞胎？\n\nA630\n00:42:31.870 --> 00:42:34.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不 我们不是亲戚 长官\n\nA631\n00:42:36.480 --> 00:42:37.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n听着\n\nA632\n00:42:37.680 --> 00:42:39.450 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这里的规矩很简单\n\nA633\n00:42:40.110 --> 00:42:41.640 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你们跟紧我\n\nA634\n00:42:41.820 --> 00:42:42.900 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n一边向其他人学习\n\nA635\n00:42:42.920 --> 00:42:45.260 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们在这儿待过一阵\n你们就会没事\n\nA636\n00:42:45.600 --> 00:42:50.600 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n士兵有<i>1</i>样装备很重要 它关系到你的生死\n\nA637\n00:42:52.060 --> 00:42:52.830 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n袜子\n\nA638\n00:42:53.240 --> 00:42:55.200 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n底部有衬垫 军绿色\n\nA639\n00:42:55.280 --> 00:42:56.560 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你要保持双脚干燥\n\nA640\n00:42:56.630 --> 00:42:59.370 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n外出行军的时候 要换袜子\n\nA641\n00:42:59.370 --> 00:43:00.700 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n每次停下来都换\n\nA642\n00:43:00.860 --> 00:43:03.470 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n湄公河会把你的脚泡烂\n\nA643\n00:43:03.710 --> 00:43:05.050 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n西姆斯中士 见鬼\n\nA644\n00:43:05.450 --> 00:43:08.000 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我让你订的吊索呢？\n\nA645\n00:43:08.060 --> 00:43:09.680 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我写到申请单上了\n\nA646\n00:43:09.740 --> 00:43:12.010 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嗯 你叫那帮狗娘养的\n\nA647\n00:43:12.080 --> 00:43:14.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n丹中尉真懂行\n\nA648\n00:43:14.250 --> 00:43:17.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n能做他的下属我觉得很幸运\n\nA649\n00:43:17.250 --> 00:43:20.920 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他来自一个军人世家\n\nA650\n00:43:20.990 --> 00:43:23.510 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他家总有人参战\n\nA651\n00:43:23.590 --> 00:43:25.060 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n并战死沙场\n\nA652\n00:43:25.130 --> 00:43:27.920 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n每一场\n\nA654\n00:43:28.000 --> 00:43:30.090 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n美国打过的战争都如此\n\nA655\n00:43:30.170 --> 00:43:32.100 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n见鬼 抓紧时间\n\nA656\n00:43:32.170 --> 00:43:33.430 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n快去做\n\nA657\n00:43:33.500 --> 00:43:34.930 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我想你可以说\n\nA658\n00:43:35.000 --> 00:43:37.440 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他背负着很重的期望\n\nA659\n00:43:38.510 --> 00:43:40.440 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你们是阿肯色州来的 对吧？\n\nA660\n00:43:40.510 --> 00:43:41.600 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嗯\n\nA661\n00:43:41.680 --> 00:43:43.440 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我去过那里\n\nA662\n00:43:43.510 --> 00:43:46.280 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n小石城是个好地方\n\nA663\n00:43:46.350 --> 00:43:48.110 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n检查好你们的装备\n\nA664\n00:43:48.180 --> 00:43:49.450 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n去找排士官\n\nA665\n00:43:49.520 --> 00:43:52.280 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n领你要用的东西\n\nA666\n00:43:52.350 --> 00:43:53.790 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n如果你们几个饿了\n\nA667\n00:43:53.860 --> 00:43:56.620 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们这儿正好在烧牛排\n\nA668\n00:43:56.690 --> 00:43:59.460 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们排有<i>2</i>条常备命令\n\nA669\n00:43:59.530 --> 00:44:02.050 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n第<i>1</i>条 照顾好自己的脚\n\nA670\n00:44:02.130 --> 00:44:05.730 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n第<i>2</i>条 尽量别干傻事\n\nA671\n00:44:05.800 --> 00:44:07.390 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n比如让你自己被打死\n\nA672\n00:44:13.640 --> 00:44:16.170 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我希望我不会令他失望\n\nA673\n00:44:27.360 --> 00:44:30.290 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我看到了许多乡村风光\n\nA674\n00:44:30.360 --> 00:44:32.760 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们常常走上很长的路\n\nA675\n00:44:41.170 --> 00:44:42.600 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们总是在找\n\nA676\n00:44:42.670 --> 00:44:44.600 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n一个叫查理的家伙\n\nA677\n00:44:53.010 --> 00:44:54.110 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n停下\n\nA678\n00:44:54.180 --> 00:44:55.620 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n停下 兄弟们\n\nA679\n00:44:58.010 --> 00:45:00.210 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n也不总是很有趣\n\nA680\n00:45:00.510 --> 00:45:03.740 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n丹中尉总是有些奇怪的感觉\n\nA681\n00:45:03.790 --> 00:45:06.720 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n看见石头、小径或道路时\n\nA682\n00:45:07.080 --> 00:45:10.030 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他会叫我们趴下 别出声\n\nA683\n00:45:10.110 --> 00:45:11.080 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n趴下\n\nA684\n00:45:11.500 --> 00:45:12.250 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n别出声\n\nA685\n00:45:13.130 --> 00:45:14.400 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们都照做\n\nA686\n00:45:32.090 --> 00:45:34.480 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我对什么都不太明白\n\nA687\n00:45:34.650 --> 00:45:38.100 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n但我觉得 参战的有些人\n是美国最优秀的年轻人\n\nA688\n00:45:38.290 --> 00:45:40.860 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n有个达拉斯 来自菲尼克斯\n\nA689\n00:45:42.570 --> 00:45:45.520 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n克利夫兰 他来自底特律\n\nA690\n00:45:45.630 --> 00:45:46.760 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 泰克斯\n\nA691\n00:45:46.990 --> 00:45:48.250 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n嘿 泰克斯\n\nA692\n00:45:48.430 --> 00:45:49.870 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他妈的怎么回事？\n\nA693\n00:45:50.440 --> 00:45